Let's go all the way down.

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:22.931
AMIR ROUZROKH: All right.

00:23:22.931 --> 00:23:23.690
I think it found--

00:23:23.690 --> 00:23:25.010
all right, see it ought
to have scaled up to--

00:23:25.010 --> 00:23:26.926
PATRICK FLYNN: That's
